  <h1 class="site-home-h2" style="font-size:2rem">Quickler writes it up. You have the last word.</h1>
  <p class="site-words">Every word on a Record can be edited, before it goes out and after. Click it and type.</p>
  <p class="site-words">Forgot a Fault until you were back at the car? Tell Quickler straight after saying done and the Record is reopened for it. Or just change the Record itself.</p>
  <p class="site-words">Every change is kept in the Record&#x27;s edit history, with who made it and when, so nothing is altered without a trace.</p>
  <p class="site-words">Quickler is built not to make things up, and it is not perfect. That is why you read the report, change what you like and sign it, as you always have.</p>
